#: e85e534d47724c74869c9865fd9050b4 of sds.tree.node.TrieNode:3
msgid ""
"A Trie node maps characters to child nodes and tracks whether it marks "
"the end of a valid word. Each node can have multiple children, indexed by"
" character."
msgstr ""

#: e41d2706dfa14b1a91f555f6183b3a98 of sds.tree.node.TrieNode:7
msgid ""
"The children are stored in a dictionary mapping characters to TrieNode "
"objects, allowing O(1) access to any child by character."
msgstr ""

#: 5f050d1c458a4869b0e6cab2f67cbd6e of sds.tree.node.TrieNode:10
msgid ""
"This is fundamentally different from TreeNode's list-based children, so "
"TrieNode inherits directly from Node rather than from TreeNode."
msgstr ""

